# Recipe 10 — The Custom Front Desk
# With the baked-in mock backend, no settings are required.
# To aim at the REAL vendor API (see README "going real"):
# POOL_API_URL=https://pool-api.vendor.example.com
# POOL_API_KEY=your-vendor-key-here

# Published port binds to loopback by default. Set to this host's LAN IP
# if your MCP client runs on another machine (see SECURITY.md).
# MCP_BIND_ADDR=192.168.1.10
